based on the current pricing grid in the Credit Facility.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Operating Partnership is subject to a number of financial covenants under the Credit Facility, including, among other things, the following as of the end of each fiscal quarter, (i)&#160;a maximum consolidated unsecured leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedUnsecuredLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenants" scale="-2" id="Narr_XGWxfuSQC0KGAFBXhyUGKg">60</ix:nonFraction>%, (ii)&#160;a maximum consolidated secured leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedSecuredLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenants" scale="-2" id="Narr_FEUyR9zggEScAVYDpdG__g">30</ix:nonFraction>%, (iii) a maximum consolidated secured recourse leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedSecuredRecourseLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenant" scale="-2" id="Narr__KE6tqZVG0-jGDnBifui3Q">10</ix:nonFraction>%, (iv) a minimum fixed charge coverage ratio of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:DebtInstrumentThresholdFixedChargeCoverageRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_Z5RrPp1WyUmHiQuMqePRRw">1.50</ix:nonFraction>:1.00, (v) a minimum unsecured interest coverage ratio of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MinimumUnsecuredInterestCoverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_-Zo_U3oQsEuCI0W_Cp0EcQ">1.50</ix:nonFraction>:1.00, (vi) a maximum consolidated leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenants" scale="0" id="Narr_dtUzInBuyEGw11TGY6a5mA">60</ix:nonFraction>%, and (vii)&#160;a minimum net worth of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_aPgcgNVntky-iLDHyvXl1g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinimumNetWorthRequiredForCompliance" scale="6" id="Narr_BDNXWM5uR0ySoYyYjmQNEg">595.6</ix:nonFraction> million plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_yzpTJQUcN0mOrIXtzBwCmg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_ODzWkfcmUUmDiblK5aqajQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:NetProceedsRaisedThroughEquityOfferingsPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_8EOxlwbfYEeN2deIG7gyrg">75</ix:nonFraction>% of all net proceeds raised through equity offerings subsequent to June 30, 2025. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_ODzWkfcmUUmDiblK5aqajQ" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCovenantCompliance" id="Narr_rQ2ys9nnaUWwIvyJ1jCWhg">As of December 31, 2025, management believed it complied with all of the financial and non-financial covenants contained in the Credit Facility.</ix:nonNumeric></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company has entered into interest rate swaps to hedge its interest rate risk on the Term Loan A Tranches and Term Loan&#160;B through their respective maturities. For additional information see the &#8220;Derivative Instruments - Interest Rate Swaps&#8221; section herein. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the&#160;year ended December&#160;31, 2025, the Company borrowed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_X7TvpG1K3USvfh1eWM_XyA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherOperatingActivitiesCashFlowStatement" scale="3" id="Narr_n7aNX8_-dkyjjmuvG5nZSQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_ODzWkfcmUUmDiblK5aqajQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLinesOfCredit" scale="3" id="Narr_-lH1avzNUUWTmi8W1FtBMg">138,300</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction><span style="color:#ee0000;"> </span>under the Credit Facility and repaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_ODzWkfcmUUmDiblK5aqajQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLinesOfCredit" scale="3" id="Narr_ZdNPjMWG8kSNd7Kh7frmcg">111,725</ix:nonFraction>, for a net amount borrowed of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_xrn_CreditFacilityMember_ODzWkfcmUUmDiblK5aqajQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" na