rr_nxcUWRGYLUivD6HTkkmSiw">22</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xrn_NotesPayableMember_uHoikfHUfEa3N-pLPEjLOQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_cEvTtlurNE6U1mJhT-MESA">44</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xrn_NotesPayableMember_iwLdDxLPXk2CTvVusKjOyA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_cwH_2bvMdEWSulQNqCFD4g">146</ix:nonFraction>, for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively, and is included in the &#8220;Interest Expense&#8221; line item in the accompanying Consolidated Statements of Operations. Additionally, in connection with the Cantor Loan defeasance $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xrn_CantorLoanMember_A26JAfPGak2-djGft9Z-aw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NotesReduction" scale="3" id="Narr_fPnzBqWwKEqkIZTLFfWaWg">240</ix:nonFraction> of unamortized debt issuance costs were written off during the year ended December 31, 2023, and included as a component of the &#8220;Loss on Extinguishment of Debt&#8221; line item in the accompanying Consolidated Statements of Operations.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March&#160;31, 2016, the Company entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PbOmBXUUdUu4FkM27LeCzw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2016_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xrn_CantorLoanMember_ZPkWTuq9mUSzJw190pLqPg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_Ffg